# On turn 1 Bot1 has an Ornithopter and Mox Sapphire, and Run Away Together is refused for the lack of a second creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Run Away Together
Ornithopter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Run Away Together.Cast
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Run Away Together
